	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nescio, an meas quas proxime cum d. <persName ref="p4069">Zulegeri</persName> literis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>misi, acceperis necne; cum enim alium non haberem nuncium, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>misi eas ad ministros, qui sunt <placeName ref="l2">Arovię</placeName>, ut inde <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ea ad vos transmitterent.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc redit ipsemet et ex<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ponet vobis, quid hic, quid item <placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> egerit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Respon<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sum hic ei tale datum est:</foreign> das min herren etwas püntnuß <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>mitt siner churfürstlichen gnaden könnind machen, besonders <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>diser zyt, könnind si nitt uß vilen ursachen; beduncke si auch <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nitt notwendig oder fürderlich sin.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="de">Si wellind aber, so imm <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>etwas zuͦston sölte, ein getrüwes ufsehen uff inn haben, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>und was si jeder zyt mitt ehren und fuͦgen imm jenen <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>fürderlichs könnind erzeigen und bewisen, das wellind si <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>thuͦn; begärind deßglichen von sinen churfürstlichen gnaden gegen <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>inen auch beschähe.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Ich achten wol, es werde bi üch <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nitt vil anders sin.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Wie es zuͦ <placeName ref="l167">Genff</placeName> und inn <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> stande, <foreign xml:lang="la">referet ipse omnia</foreign>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tretium <placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>reliquit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hic nihil aliud habemus, nisi quod nostri <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>denuo clam valde sollicitantur ad foedus ineundum <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>cum <placeName ref="l832">Gallis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Ich wölt gern, das si uns dalime ruͤwig <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ließind; han drumb nitt ungern gsen, das man mitt <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dem hertzogen fridete, das ich gehofft, so die gfärlikeit <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>hinüber, wurde man nitt ursach han, sich mitt <placeName ref="l832">Franck<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>rych</placeName> inzuͦlaßen.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Aber es gat noch starck, wiewol still <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>und heimlich.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Et haec tibi scripsero; nolim ea rescire <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quemquam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Spero brevi in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> aliquid exoriturum, quo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>deterreantur nostri, ne se immisceant.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>heri rediit <placeName ref="l2245">Cameraco</placeName>, necdum locutus sum cum illo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Remitto tibi landgravii literas et vestrum responsum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Quid <placeName ref="l167">Genevenses</placeName> responderint, monstrabit tibi d. <persName ref="p4069">Zulegerus</persName><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> ei communicavit vestrum quoque responsum; <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>hoc ideo scribo, ne putes me incautius ill esse usum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Bene vale.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te omnes nostri.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem precor quoque tuis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 8. iulii 1567.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[ohannes] <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Hall[erus</persName>] tuus semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro domino <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, summa mihi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>observantia colendo domino ac com<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>patri.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
